    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649-a1">

                <pb facs="0807" n="697" xml:id="pg697"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Exhibit A in affidavit of George
                        Provenzano.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>New Orleans</placeName>
                        <date ana="#date_apparent-typo-based-on-document-scan" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-07-30">July 30th i887</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>One of your noble Band was killed and all of you aregoing to find the same
                    fate</p>
                <p>_____________________ ________BEWARE______________</p>
                <p>One of your gang by the name of</p>
                <p>___________________ AMMATO ________</p>
                <p>Must leave this city Do not give him any more work or you will get yourself in
                    trouble</p>
                <p>we are still alive look out for</p>
                <p>US</p>
                <p>K K K ________N____</p>
                <p>Commander</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
